    "name": "Match Tree",
    "steam_appid": 3010870,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010870/extras/121cc1fb88dc4a294fff1185dae620b6.poster.avif?t=1751636969\" width=800 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010870/extras/121cc1fb88dc4a294fff1185dae620b6.webm?t=1751636969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010870/extras/121cc1fb88dc4a294fff1185dae620b6.mp4?t=1751636969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match Tree is a match 3 game, where each of your turns has consequences.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge plants sown by pixies, gnomes and witches.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bushes become trees, trees become houses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules are simple, the levels are short and you will refine your puzzle skills with each round.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you clever enough to face the challenges of the various levels?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010870/extras/f8e8de965a9e1df031359f94ef5dd829.poster.avif?t=1751636969\" width=800 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010870/extras/f8e8de965a9e1df031359f94ef5dd829.webm?t=1751636969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010870/extras/f8e8de965a9e1df031359f94ef5dd829.mp4?t=1751636969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The characters sow plants for you to merge and upgrade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010870/extras/66e841b566a7b55f069ea2f7a81a7ae0.poster.avif?t=1751636969\" width=800 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010870/extras/66e841b566a7b55f069ea2f7a81a7ae0.webm?t=1751636969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010870/extras/66e841b566a7b55f069ea2f7a81a7ae0.mp4?t=1751636969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hex fields allow a multitude of different combinations. Decide how many plants you merge and where to grow the result.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010870/extras/d8463b6bce0302d66087da9e70aa1b74.poster.avif?t=1751636969\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010870/extras/d8463b6bce0302d66087da9e70aa1b74.webm?t=1751636969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010870/extras/d8463b6bce0302d66087da9e70aa1b74.mp4?t=1751636969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s your decision where to place characters, when they are stuck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010870/extras/400b6c32f157067997dc01b5c3d2fc40.poster.avif?t=1751636969\" width=800 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010870/extras/400b6c32f157067997dc01b5c3d2fc40.webm?t=1751636969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010870/extras/400b6c32f157067997dc01b5c3d2fc40.mp4?t=1751636969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use tools, like the magic wand to solve tricky situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010870/extras/da09cff56509d5d6749913a7179f31e1.poster.avif?t=1751636969\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010870/extras/da09cff56509d5d6749913a7179f31e1.webm?t=1751636969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010870/extras/da09cff56509d5d6749913a7179f31e1.mp4?t=1751636969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware of the hangry sheep!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010870/extras/121cc1fb88dc4a294fff1185dae620b6.poster.avif?t=1751636969\" width=800 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010870/extras/121cc1fb88dc4a294fff1185dae620b6.webm?t=1751636969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010870/extras/121cc1fb88dc4a294fff1185dae620b6.mp4?t=1751636969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match Tree is a match 3 game, where each of your turns has consequences.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge plants sown by pixies, gnomes and witches.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bushes become trees, trees become houses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules are simple, the levels are short and you will refine your puzzle skills with each round.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you clever enough to face the challenges of the various levels?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010870/extras/f8e8de965a9e1df031359f94ef5dd829.poster.avif?t=1751636969\" width=800 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010870/extras/f8e8de965a9e1df031359f94ef5dd829.webm?t=1751636969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010870/extras/f8e8de965a9e1df031359f94ef5dd829.mp4?t=1751636969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The characters sow plants for you to merge and upgrade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video 