/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010870/extras/400b6c32f157067997dc01b5c3d2fc40.mp4?t=1751636969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use tools, like the magic wand to solve tricky situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010870/extras/da09cff56509d5d6749913a7179f31e1.poster.avif?t=1751636969\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010870/extras/da09cff56509d5d6749913a7179f31e1.webm?t=1751636969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010870/extras/da09cff56509d5d6749913a7179f31e1.mp4?t=1751636969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware of the hangry sheep!</p>",
